<title>THAILAND: Asia Credit Q3 net profit up 21.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Asia Credit Q3 net profit up 21.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 3.38	 vs	   2.77</p>
<p>    Net profit	     258.10	 vs	 212.20</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		10.29	 vs	   8.02</p>
<p>    Net profit	     786.82	 vs	 612.13</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Asia Credit Plc, a finance and securities company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
